# Ship on finish

After a code change is done, ship it. Do not ask whether to commit, push, or deploy.

1. Commit on `main`. English conventional commits (`type(scope): imperative`). CHANGELOG in simple Chinese. No PRs.
2. Wait for CI on **this commit**, then `tools/deploy.sh`.
3. Do not put member names, Discord IDs, IPs, or live Keys/tokens in git.

Do not commit untracked research dirs or secrets. Do not skip hooks. Do not force-push main.
